# CI/CD

- Keep CI separate from CD. Follow `docs/engineering/CI_CD.md`.
- Do not add a GitHub Actions, GitLab, or hosting workflow until an ADR names the provider.
- Do not adopt `originals` or the scaffold `.github/workflows/ci.yml` as the pipeline.
- Migrations run before traffic. Take a backup before a production migration.
